# Devcontainer build context filter.
# Both .devcontainer/ profiles set context to the repo root. Without this
# file the entire repo (.git, node_modules, .venv, .terraform, etc.) is
# sent to the Docker daemon on every build.
#
# Allow only the config and image inputs used by the Dockerfile.
*
!.devcontainer/Dockerfile
!.devcontainer/devcontainer.json
!.devcontainer/agent/devcontainer.json
!.devcontainer/dev/devcontainer.json
!.devcontainer/config/
